{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"ec29dd6eba07bf8041391174526d4d6dfcb1e840aff31032e2cf5b79335c172a","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_d9d90c2fc2eb4978f185da6afeb42d0df1e860a7acc0b13b55fa328d5d2acd4c","overall_assessment":"The paper is well-organized and clearly written, with a logical flow from motivation to methodology and results. The mathematical notation is consistent and well-defined, and the tables are readable and informative. The main clarity weakness is the lack of a formal algorithmic summary for the core ranking and control procedures, which are described in prose and equations but not consolidated into pseudocode.","paper_id":"H1z-PsR5KX","paper_identity_sha256":"b3f4a71784cb989bb7fd5df4afd936e796ddd99323ac171ca742f6bb86b53718","prompt_identity_sha256":"84d9d53a1eb53057cf32d466a8646aab39a7bd97d416d044aa99578d8a7bbd32","raw_response_sha256":"e1047afc6642b01cef77de4e56d0f93de4a3afac79cf139319670e159e952f59","request_identity_sha256":"5bfbd54afc8393ba68632398801434b1965f42378872bc42b7ce620ca196278e","reviewer_identity_sha256":"32b29c26fbf1508e066dfb25b1a9a3fe0654c5869a7da3020e1e8e61940befe3","role":"CLAR","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"add01a5133f933d81c362f063222a06d19786d5f332829b0fdf74816ed9c6ee0","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-008","SRC-010","SRC-011","SRC-012","SRC-029"],"review_text":"The paper is well-structured, with a clear progression from the introduction of the problem to the methodology, experimental setup, and results. The writing is concise and readable, and the terminology is used consistently. However, the presentation of the core algorithms (neuron ranking and translation control) relies heavily on prose descriptions and individual equations rather than a consolidated pseudocode or algorithm block. For instance, the ranking methods (MaxCorr, MinCorr, LinReg, SVCCA) are described in separate paragraphs with equations, and the control protocol is listed as a numbered list. While understandable, a formal algorithmic summary would improve the self-containedness and ease of reproduction for expert readers.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-WRT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-008","SRC-010","SRC-011","SRC-013","SRC-029"],"review_text":"The mathematical notation is consistent and well-defined. Key variables such as the activation h_t^m[i], the random variable x_i^m, and the correlation coefficient rho are clearly introduced and used consistently throughout the methodology and results sections. The equations for the ranking methods (MaxCorr, MinCorr) and the erasure projection are presented clearly. The definition of the modification value alpha in the control section is also explicit. No significant inconsistencies or missing definitions were found in the mathematical exposition.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-NOT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-009","SRC-013","SRC-018","SRC-024","SRC-031"],"review_text":"The machine-readable tables (Table 1, Table 3, Table 4) are well-formatted and readable, with clear column headers and data entries that support the textual analysis. The caption for Figure 1 is detailed, explaining the illustration of the correlation methods and the number of models used. The captions for Figures 2, 3, and 4 are consistent with the figure references in the text and provide sufficient context for the visual results. The textual descriptions of the visual aids (e.g., heatmaps, erasure plots) are clear and align with the reported findings.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-FIG"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"d3ff2f56adaf47194a3ded2134725700a69d8d0cfa6137c7c3436f7eef421e91","paper_id":"H1z-PsR5KX","paper_ordinal":100,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"e1047afc6642b01cef77de4e56d0f93de4a3afac79cf139319670e159e952f59","attempt_index":0,"error":"","finish_reason":"stop","paper_id":"H1z-PsR5KX","raw_provider_response_base64":"","raw_provider_response_sha256":"784c